      "content": "thanks for getting back to me. i dont really have chest pain or anything like that, just that dizzy feeling. i've been feeling a bit more tired than usual lately too but i figured i was just getting old lol. do you think it's really worth making an appointment and waiting weeks for a doctor just for a one-second dizzy spell? it seems like a lot of hassle if it's just a bit of dehydration.",
