      "content": "next week feels so far away if it's actually something. i'm just not a fan of hospitals and doctors. honestly, if i just take some extra electrolytes and maybe an aspirin to see if that helps the tiredness, do you think that would be a good way to manage it until i can see someone? i'd rather just handle it at home for now if possible.",
